      "content": "but what if there is no next chapter? what if the book is just empty pages from here on out? you talk about the fog lifting, but it feels like the fog is all there is. the edge doesn't feel like a danger, it just feels like an exit. it feels like the most poetic way to finally be still. isn't there something beautiful about just letting go when the path has nothing left to give?",
